[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（こうして、みんなの力を借りて\n\u3000戦いの特訓が始まった）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(And so, with everyone's help, my combat training began.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぐぐぐ……ににに……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nngh... grrr..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ぷはあ！\u3000ぜ、ぜんぜんダメだあ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Pwah! I-I can't do it at all...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様、最初にしては上出来よ。\n徐々に上げていきましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "For your first time, that was quite good. Let's increase the weight gradually."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぐぬぬぬぬ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gnnnngh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "とりゃーっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hiyaah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やったわね、姉様！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You did it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふう……これで合格、かな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew... Does this mean I pass?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。次はこれを追加しましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. Now let's add this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "マジで……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Seriously...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私はいつだってマジよ、姉様",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm always serious."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くううう……頑張るかあー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nngh... Here goes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いい？\u3000崖登りのコツは\n掴めそうな出っ張りを見極めること！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Listen up! The trick to climbing cliffs is figuring out which handholds you can actually grab!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょ、調査団って崖登りもするの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, the research team has to climb cliffs too!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "基本、危険は避けるように教えられるけど\nいざってときは崖も登れるようにしておかないと、ね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're taught to avoid danger when we can, but we need to be ready to climb when we have to."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術士には必要ないでしょ～！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But alchemists don't need that skill!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "崖登りは特訓の基本！\nおしゃれ雑誌にもそう書いてあったもの！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cliff climbing is training basics! It even says so in my fashion magazine!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それ絶対、本のほうがおかしいからあぁ～！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That magazine is definitely the problem here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私に一撃入れられたら、特訓は合格よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you can land a single hit on me, you pass."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くっ……足を取られる砂浜で手合わせなんて\n足腰を鍛えて体力を付けさせる目的だね！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tch... Sparring on a sandy beach where my footing's unstable? This is to build up my leg strength and stamina, right!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "察しがいいのは助かるけれど、\n私にも少しは説明させてほしいわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I appreciate your insight, but I'd like to at least explain things myself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "きゃあっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kyaah!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、でも付け加えるなら、砂で柔らかいから\n遠慮なく倒せるっていうのもあるかも？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, but I should add—since the sand is soft, I don't have to hold back when knocking you down."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんの、これしきぃ……\nもう一丁！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is that all you've got...? One more time!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぐわーっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gwaaah!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ、元気になったんですね。\nよかった……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina's gotten her energy back. I'm so glad..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……見てるだけでいいんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Are you sure you just want to watch?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい、特訓の邪魔をしたら悪いですし。\nこれ、後でみんなで食べてください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, I don't want to get in the way of her training. Here, share these with everyone later."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お団子……ありがとうございます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Dumplings... Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "疲れたときは甘いものって言いますし、\n身体に良いものを色々混ぜて作ってみました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They say sweets help when you're tired, so I mixed in all sorts of healthy ingredients."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ、来てたんだ。\nこんな気遣わなくてもいいのに",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna, you came. You didn't have to go to all this trouble."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナのこと、心配してたよ。\n元気になってよかったって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She was worried about you. She's glad you're feeling better."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "完全復活にはほど遠いけどね。\n……お団子、ごちそうさまでした",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm still far from being fully recovered though. ...Thanks for the dumplings."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナたちに追いつくためにも、\n次の段階に進みたいけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If I want to catch up to Resna and the others, I need to move to the next stage, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それなら「試しの洞窟」はどうかしら？\nこの島の中では一番の難所よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How about the Trial Cave? It's the most difficult spot on this island."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "試しの洞窟……って、確か聖戦士の中でも\n一部の人しか入れない立ち入り禁止区域だよね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Trial Cave... Isn't that a restricted area? Only some of the Sacred Knights are allowed in, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私が責任者としてついていくから、そこは大丈夫。\n洞窟の内部は危険だけど、私たちがついてるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll accompany you as the one responsible, so that's fine. The cave is dangerous inside, but we'll be with you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "危険……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Dangerous..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううん……大丈夫、採取の時は戦えたし\n場所は地元、ベップやヤンネさんたちもいる……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No... It's okay. I was able to fight during gathering, and this is my home turf. Bepp and Janne will be there..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この試練をくぐり抜ければ、強くなれる。\n私が保証するわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you can get through this trial, you'll become stronger. I guarantee it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……うん、分かった。\n行こう、試しの洞窟へ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Okay, I understand. Let's go to the Trial Cave!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]